le: Grafana Architecture — Metrics Architecture and Collection — Grafana Architecture [stage-12-topic-13-section-17]\n\nUse this section ID and navigation topic when validating implementation,\ncommands, configuration examples, operational evidence, failure conditions,\nrecovery procedures, and production acceptance criteria for this lesson."
